          </h2>

          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Is Ascent protein a whey isolate?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Partly. Ascent's flagship whey lists a whey isolate blend of native whey isolate and regular whey isolate, followed by whey concentrate. So it is mostly isolate, with some concentrate. The Clear Whey Isolate is a pure isolate. If you need a pure isolate for lactose sensitivity, read the ingredient list on the specific product before you buy.
